---
layout: base.njk
title: "AeroClub | Spring 2027 Command Dashboard"
---
<style>
    .dashboard-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(100%, 320px), 1fr)); gap: clamp(24px, 4vw, 40px); }
    .phase-card { background: var(--bg-deep); border: 1px solid var(--border-dark); border-top: 4px solid var(--accent-cyan); padding: 40px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; transition: all 0.3s ease; border-radius: 4px; text-decoration: none; position: relative; overflow: hidden; }
    .phase-card:hover { border-color: var(--text-light); transform: translateY(-4px); box-shadow: 0 12px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.2); }
    .phase-number { position: absolute; top: -20px; right: -10px; font-size: 140px; font-weight: 900; line-height: 1; color: transparent; -webkit-text-stroke: 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.05); z-index: 0; pointer-events: none; transition: all 0.3s ease; }
    .phase-card:hover .phase-number { -webkit-text-stroke: 1px rgba(14, 165, 233, 0.15); transform: translateX(-10px); }
    .phase-content { position: relative; z-index: 1; flex: 1; display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
    .phase-meta { font-family: var(--font-data); font-size: 12px; margin-bottom: 24px; display: inline-block; letter-spacing: 1px; text-transform: uppercase; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 4px; width: fit-content; background: rgba(14, 165, 233, 0.1); color: var(--accent-cyan); border: 1px solid rgba(14, 165, 233, 0.2); }
    .phase-card h4 { font-size: 24px; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 16px; color: var(--text-light); letter-spacing: -0.5px; }
    .phase-card p { font-size: 15px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 32px; flex: 1; }
    .view-report { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--accent-cyan); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; border-top: 1px solid var(--border-dark); padding-top: 24px; margin-top: auto; transition: color 0.2s; }
    .view-report::after { content: '→'; transition: transform 0.2s; }
    .phase-card:hover .view-report::after { transform: translateX(6px); }
</style>

<main id="command-dashboard">
    <section style="padding: clamp(60px, 8vw, 100px) 0 clamp(40px, 5vw, 60px); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-dark);">
        <div class="container">
            <a href="/join_us/" style="font-family: var(--font-data); color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-transform: uppercase; text-decoration: none; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 32px; transition: color 0.2s;">← Back to Archives</a>
            <h4 style="font-family: var(--font-data); color: var(--accent-cyan); font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 12px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-transform: uppercase;">TESTING MODE: ALL PHASES UNLOCKED</h4>
            <h2 style="font-size: clamp(40px, 8vw, 56px); font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 24px; color: var(--text-light); letter-spacing: -1px; line-height: 1.1;">Spring 2027 Dashboard</h2>
            <div style="background: var(--bg-panel-dark); border: 1px solid var(--border-dark); padding: 24px; border-radius: 4px; max-width: 800px;">
                <h4 style="font-family: var(--font-data); font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-muted); letter-spacing: 1px; margin-bottom: 12px;">ACTIVE RECRUITMENT ROLES</h4>
                <p style="color: var(--text-light); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; font-weight: 500;">
                    Aerodynamics <span style="color: var(--border-dark);">//</span> Embedded Systems <span style="color: var(--border-dark);">//</span> Payload Integration <span style="color: var(--border-dark);">//</span> Web Design
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section style="padding: clamp(60px, 8vw, 100px) 0;">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="dashboard-grid">
                <a href="/join_us/spring-2027/application/" class="phase-card"><span class="phase-number">01</span><div class="phase-content"><span class="phase-meta">PHASE 01</span><h4>Initial Applications</h4><p>Role breakdowns, technical expectations, and the primary application portal.</p><span class="view-report">Read Report</span></div></a>
                <a href="/join_us/spring-2027/test/" class="phase-card"><span class="phase-number">02</span><div class="phase-content"><span class="phase-meta">PHASE 02</span><h4>Technical Test</h4><p>Syllabus breakdown, evaluation metrics, and logistical details for the written examination.</p><span class="view-report">Read Report</span></div></a>
                <a href="/join_us/spring-2027/shortlist/" class="phase-card"><span class="phase-number">03</span><div class="phase-content"><span class="phase-meta">PHASE 03</span><h4>Test Shortlist</h4><p>Official roster of candidates advancing to the technical interview rounds.</p><span class="view-report">Read Report</span></div></a>
                <a href="/join_us/spring-2027/interview/" class="phase-card"><span class="phase-number">04</span><div class="phase-content"><span class="phase-meta">PHASE 04</span><h4>Interviews</h4><p>Panel schedules, time-slots, and preparation guidelines for shortlisted applicants.</p><span class="view-report">Read Report</span></div></a>
                <a href="/join_us/spring-2027/results/" class="phase-card"><span class="phase-number">05</span><div class="phase-content"><span class="phase-meta">PHASE 05</span><h4>Final Results</h4><p>The finalized list of inducted members for the Spring 2027 competition cycle.</p><span class="view-report">Read Report</span></div></a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
</main>
